  "description": "GeoChat is the first grounded large vision-language model (VLM) for remote sensing, capable of multitask conversational capabilities with high-resolution RS images, including image/region captioning, VQA, scene classification, visually grounded conversations, and referring detection. It is based on LLaVA-1.5 and Vicuna-v1.5, with a CLIP-ViT(L-14) visual backbone and LoRA fine-tuning.",
